cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "cdv-phylodynamics: a reproducible pipeline for canine distemper virus phylodynamics"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline for analysing canine distemper virus (Morbillivirus
  canis) hemagglutinin gene sequences from GenBank: metadata curation,
  alignment QC, maximum likelihood phylogeny, clade delineation, stratified
  subsampling, Bayesian phylodynamic inference with discrete host-state
  reconstruction, and export to an annotated Auspice dataset. Applied to an
  America-2 lineage circulating in North American carnivores. Amino acid
  coordinates follow the H CDS of A75/17 (AF164967).
type: software
authors:
